    <data key="d0">snaq.me Personalized Notification Architecture with Amazon Pinpoint</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nPVkewp8-vo</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture built by snaq.me using AWS Batch, S3, SNS, Step Functions, DynamoDB, Amazon Pinpoint, and AWS Lambda to deliver personalized email and LINE messages, reducing routine workload by 4 hours per week.</data>
